Package: dfmtools
Title: Bayesian Inference of Dynamic Factor Models
Version: 0.0.1
Date: 2024-09-30
Authors@R: person(c("Franz", "X."), "Mohr", email = "franz.x.mohr@outlook.com", role = c("aut","cre"), comment = c(ORCiD = "0009-0003-8890-7781"))
Description: Assists in the set-up of algorithms for Bayesian inference of dynamic factor models. Functions for posterior simulation, forecasting, impulse response analysis and forecast error variance decomposition are largely based on the introductory texts of Chan, Koop, Poirier and Tobias (2019, ISBN: 9781108437493) and Luetkepohl (2006, ISBN: 9783540262398).
License: GPL (>= 3)
Depends: R (>= 3.4.0), bvartools (>= 0.3.0), Matrix
Imports:
    coda,
    methods,
    Rcpp (>= 0.12.14),
    stats
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo
LazyData: true
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
URL: https://github.com/franzmohr/dfmtools
BugReports: https://github.com/franzmohr/dfmtools/issues
